---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="B2B Memory Sourcing and Supply Continuity"
  description="DDR4 and DDR5 memory sourcing for European businesses, plus fixed-scope RAM supply continuity reviews. Exact part numbers, tested stock, transparent fees."
>
  <section class="container top">
    <p class="eyebrow">B2B service · Europe · Independent engineering</p>
    <h1>Need specific RAM? Get a verified quote, not a speculative listing.</h1>
    <p class="lead">I source exact DDR4 and DDR5 server, laptop and industrial memory part numbers from European hardware suppliers. Each proposed transaction is checked for part number, available quantity, condition, testing, warranty and delivery terms before any order.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button" href="mailto:andrii@shylenko.com?subject=B2B%20RAM%20sourcing%20request">Request a memory quote</a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="mailto:andrii@shylenko.com?subject=RAM%20supply%20continuity%20review">Request a supply-risk review</a>
    </div>
    <p class="availability">I do not advertise or reserve stock I do not own. Supplier availability and pricing are confirmed separately for each request.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="container section-block">
    <div class="offers">
      <article class="card offer">
        <p class="eyebrow">Service 01 · Buyer-led procurement</p>
        <h2>Find the exact memory module</h2>
        <p>For IT resellers, system integrators, server operators and refurbishers. Send the MPN or compatible platform, quantity and ship-to location. I seek written supplier terms and return a comparable sourcing proposal before any purchase decision.</p>
        <p class="price">5% of accepted hardware value <span>ex VAT, minimum €250</span></p>
        <p class="fine">Success fee only, invoiced after hardware is delivered and accepted. No upfront sourcing fee. Supplier invoices and delivery terms are agreed per transaction.</p>
        <a href="mailto:andrii@shylenko.com?subject=Memory%20purchase%20RFQ&body=Required%20MPN%3A%0AQuantity%3A%0ACondition%2Fwarranty%3A%0ADestination%3A%0ARequired%20date%3A">Submit an RFQ →</a>
      </article>
      <article class="card offer">
        <p class="eyebrow">Service 02 · Embedded / OEM engineering</p>
        <h2>Reduce risk from unavailable RAM</h2>
        <p>A fixed-scope review of one memory component or module family. Check electrical and firmware dependencies, identify possible alternatives, and outline validation steps before a board redesign or purchasing commitment.</p>
        <p class="price">€490 <span>per component-family review, ex VAT</span></p>
        <p class="fine">Deliverable: written compatibility and supply-risk report, candidate paths where technically feasible, and a test plan. PCB redesign, hardware procurement and physical testing are separately quoted. Start only after scope and invoice approval.</p>
        <a href="mailto:andrii@shylenko.com?subject=RAM%20supply%20continuity%20review&body=Current%20RAM%20part%3A%0AHost%20controller%3A%0AAnnual%20volume%3A%0ASupply%20issue%3A">Request the review →</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container section-block">
    <h2>How a sourcing order works</h2>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step"><strong>01 — Specify.</strong><p>Provide part number, interface, capacity, speed, rank, ECC/registered type, quantity and deadline. For server upgrades, include the host model.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><strong>02 — Validate.</strong><p>Receive an itemised supplier quote with source, exact MPN, tested grade and evidence available, VAT and freight treatment, warranty, DOA terms and quote expiry.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><strong>03 — Confirm.</strong><p>You review and approve a written offer before anyone places an order. There is no purchase obligation from submitting an RFQ.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><strong>04 — Deliver.</strong><p>Shipment, inspection and payment happen under agreed order terms. A separate sourcing fee is due only after accepted delivery.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container section-block">
    <div class="details">
      <h2>Send a useful request</h2>
      <p>Copy the label on your current DIMM or state the exact target manufacturer part number. Include whether new, tested refurbished or either is acceptable; your quantity; shipping country; desired warranty; and the deadline. Unspecified compatibility is not assumed.</p>
      <p>For businesses retiring servers, send an inventory manifest instead. I can evaluate whether a verified buyer exists before proposing any sale. I do not guarantee a bid or claim to buy hardware without an agreed order.</p>
      <p><strong>Contact:</strong> <a href="mailto:andrii@shylenko.com">andrii@shylenko.com</a> · Andrii Shylenko · Budapest, Hungary</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container bottom">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Next step</p>
      <h2>Tell me the exact part you need.</h2>
      <p>No stock claims, no speculative purchase order, no obligation until a written quote is accepted.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="button" href="mailto:andrii@shylenko.com?subject=B2B%20RAM%20sourcing%20request">Request a quote</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  h1 { max-width: 900px; font-size: clamp(2.3rem,6vw,4.4rem); line-height:1.09; letter-spacing:-0.035em; margin: 12px 0 22px; }
  h2 { line-height:1.18; font-size:clamp(1.4rem,3vw,2rem); margin:0 0 14px; }
  .top { padding-block:72px 36px; }
  .lead { max-width:820px; font-size:clamp(1.05rem,2vw,1.3rem); color:var(--muted); }
  .actions { display:flex; gap:12px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-block:28px 15px; }
  .availability { font-size:.88rem; color:var(--muted); max-width:680px; }
  .section-block { padding-block:38px; }
  .offers { display:grid; gap:18px; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); }
  .offer { padding:28px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0; }
  .offer>p:not(.eyebrow) { color:var(--muted); }
  .offer .price { color:var(--text) !important; font-size:1.7rem; font-weight:750; margin:15px 0 0; }
  .price span { display:block; font-weight:400; font-size:.9rem; color:var(--muted); }
  .offer .fine { font-size:.87rem; }
  .offer a { margin-top:auto; font-weight:650; }
  .steps { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:18px; }
  .step { padding:24px; border-top:2px solid var(--border); }
  .step strong { font-size:1.1rem; }
  .step p { color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:0; }
  .details { max-width:860px; }
  .details p { color:var(--muted); }
  .bottom { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:24px; padding:28px; margin-block:30px 72px; border-radius:10px; background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--border); }
  .bottom h2 { margin:0; }
  .bottom p { color:var(--muted); }
  @media(max-width:700px) { .top{padding-top:38px;} .offers,.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;} .bottom{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;} .offer{padding:20px;} }
</style>
